{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":17,"ref":"1-chronicles 29:17","book":"1-chronicles","lang":"id","chapter":29,"translation":"Dan aku tahu, Elohim-ku, bahwa-engkau Menguji hati dan kelayakan ⟨kau⟩-rindui; aku dalam lurusnya hati-ku telah-menawarkan-diri semua ini, dan sekarang umat-mu yang-dijumpai-di sini telah-kulihat dengan-sukacita untuk-menawarkan-diri kepada-mu.","tokens":[{"surface":"וידעתי","gloss":"dan aku tahu"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"Elohim-ku"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"bahwa"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"engkau"},{"surface":"בחן","gloss":"Menguji"},{"surface":"לבב","gloss":"hati"},{"surface":"ומישרים","gloss":"dan kelayakan"},{"surface":"תרצה","gloss":"⟨kau⟩-rindui"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"aku"},{"surface":"בישר","gloss":"dalam lurusnya"},{"surface":"לבבי","gloss":"hati-ku"},{"surface":"התנדבתי","gloss":"telah-menawarkan-diri"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"semua"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"ini"},{"surface":"ועתה","gloss":"dan sekarang"},{"surface":"עמך","gloss":"umat-mu"},{"surface":"הנמצאו","gloss":"yang-dijumpai-di"},{"surface":"פה","gloss":"sini"},{"surface":"ראיתי","gloss":"telah-kulihat"},{"surface":"בשמחה","gloss":"dengan-sukacita"},{"surface":"להתנדב","gloss":"untuk-menawarkan-diri"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"kepada-mu"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T12:04:04.962758121Z","model":"glm-5.2"}